msgstr "![ผลลัพธ์ของ code cell ก่อนหน้า](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/get-started-with-qiskit/extracted-outputs/6c215e46-26cb-4e10-a1d7-2eecd2c18294-0.avif)\n"

