msgstr "![ผลลัพธ์ของ code cell ก่อนหน้า](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/get-started-with-qiskit/extracted-outputs/7bca3c98-884b-4709-bbe8-a9e16cc45698-0.avif)\n"

