msgstr "![ผลลัพธ์ของ code cell ก่อนหน้า](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/get-started-with-qiskit/extracted-outputs/118da691-4208-4248-a21f-a5e22815dc2c-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
